<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Experience Mechanic Workshop - Car Mantri</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn what makes the Car Mantri mechanic workshop reliable, transparent, and practical for everyday car maintenance and repairs."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Experience Our Mechanic Workshop</h2>
        <p class="section-text">
          Car Mantri is built around a workshop experience that is simple to
          understand, easy to trust, and focused on getting your vehicle back
          on the road quickly. Our mechanics combine hands-on expertise with
          modern diagnostics so every visit is efficient and transparent.
        </p>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 22px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">What you can expect</h3>
          <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; color: #1f2937">
            <li>Certified mechanics who inspect the issue before starting work</li>
            <li>Clear service explanations so you know what is being done</li>
            <li>Fast turnaround for routine maintenance and common repairs</li>
            <li>Quality checks before delivery to reduce repeat problems</li>
            <li>Support for cars, SUVs, hatchbacks, and light commercial vehicles</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">Why our workshop stands out</h3>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #1f2937">
            We keep the workshop process straightforward. First, our team reviews
            your vehicle symptoms and performs a quick diagnosis. Then we share
            the repair plan, parts needed, and estimated cost before work begins.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #1f2937">
            That approach helps you make informed decisions and gives you a
            better understanding of your vehicle's condition, not just a repair
            receipt.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">Best for</h3>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1f2937">
            Routine servicing, brake inspections, oil changes, diagnostics,
            battery checks, AC issues, and general mechanical repairs.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #1f2937">
            If you want a workshop that focuses on honest communication and
            practical repair advice, this is the right place to start.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
    <%- include("../partials/loginModal") %>
  </body>
</html>
